    rx_technician:{ rx_crossing:"S&T Tech Mara Doss tests a track relay at The Crossing & Points. \"If detection disappears, the signal should become more restrictive, never more generous.\"", rx_signalbox:"At The Signalling Control Centre, S&T Tech Mara Doss draws attention to a false clear on the panel. \"The driver saw seconds of information built from months of deferred maintenance.\"", rx_office:"S&T Tech Mara Doss places a temporary strap beside the fault log in The Infrastructure Head Office. \"This wire kept trains moving by removing the condition that kept them apart.\"" },
